{"body":"## Summary\n- split the grenade tutorial hint into six translated action tokens in both tutorial and labyrinth levels: hold `G+RMB`, flick right, release RMB, hold RMB again, release G, aim/release RMB\n- compute grenade strikethrough progress from completed action text so `[дёрнуть мышкой вправо]` is crossed after the flick while `[отпустить ПКМ]` stays active until the actual RMB release\n- allow grenade hint rollback to reset visible strikethrough progress and cancel stale forward tweens without changing existing forward-only behavior for other hints\n- keep the final aim/release step highlighted until the grenade-thrown signal dismisses the hint\n- add English/Russian translation keys for the grenade hint and regression coverage for tutorial/labyrinth sequencing, rollback, and English locale text\n- update `docs/case-studies/issue-1818/` analysis with the latest owner feedback and the Godot Input reference used for the state-transition review\n\n## Testing\n- `git diff --check`\n- `dotnet build` (passes with 94 existing warnings, 0 errors)\n- `/tmp/godot-ci/godot/Godot_v4.3-stable_mono_linux.x86_64 --headless -s addons/gut/gut_cmdln.gd -gconfig=res://gut_issue1818.json` with a temporary focused config for `test_tutorial_level.gd` and `test_labyrinth_level.gd`: 2 scripts, 159 tests passing\n\nNote: the default tracked `.gutconfig.json` runs the broader unit/integration tree. A local broad run was stopped after it reached an unrelated hanging `test_enemy_teleport_component.gd` case; the focused regression suites above completed successfully.\n\nFixes Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP#1818\n","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-04-15T16:52:15Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-04-15T16:52:15Z","messageBody":"Adding .gitkeep for PR creation (default mode).\nThis file will be removed when the task is complete.\n\nIssue: https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/1818","messageHeadline":"Initial commit with task details","oid":"e57e850eb4d52deb161d4cc2eb7b30f87a226947"},{"authoredDate":"2026-04-15T17:00:31Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-04-15T17:00:31Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Fix grenade tutorial steps for issue 1818","oid":"5d6a6f736aa39a52b526c88277ffc01a7587992d"},{"authoredDate":"2026-04-15T17:07:58Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-04-15T17:07:58Z","messageBody":"This reverts commit e57e850eb4d52deb161d4cc2eb7b30f87a226947.","messageHeadline":"Revert \"Initial commit with task details\"","oid":"858ba32f6cec308b53c28d9c2a5fdea2a62cbfb1"},{"authoredDate":"2026-04-15T23:46:10Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-04-15T23:46:10Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"fix grenade tutorial review feedback","oid":"8fb02001f0cede880e2d59e765a85a06a72b8956"},{"authoredDate":"2026-04-16T00:36:29Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-04-16T00:36:29Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Merge upstream/main into issue-1818-8c84382063a9","oid":"c784616f5dde2d5a5bcf396e88bf13721033df89"},{"authoredDate":"2026-04-16T00:41:26Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-04-16T00:41:26Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Fix grenade tutorial hint transitions","oid":"0cfba2fec0ee0e2d8519ae1bde6034b1a9b4ad0b"},{"authoredDate":"2026-04-16T07:04:21Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-04-16T07:04:21Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Fix grenade hint action progress","oid":"2791bb4908b